#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""System doctor: measures what slows this Mac — process births, the kernel's CPU share, memory compression and
swap, disk writes and reads, free space, crashes, hangs and reboots — unprivileged, and writes
~/.cache/system-doctor/latest.json in the shape of docs/doctors-contract.md (design docs/system-doctor-design.md).
No network, no LLM. `agent` is the LaunchAgent's minute: one light tick, the nightly pass when due, the document
every 10 minutes."""

